IMt", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1686720874, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "932173", "format": "epub", "version": 160268835, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/173/932173/s_932173.jpg", "title": "都柏林人（译文名著精选）", "author": "[爱尔兰]詹姆斯·乔伊斯", "translator": "王逢振", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "赛车以后", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7IXF20Sil", "review": {"bookId": "932173", "content": "这种事实描写感觉一般，缺乏细节描写，是乔伊斯觉得不重要吗？", "bookVersion": 2075553544, "range": "3302-3435", "abstract": "在强烈的感染之下，吉米觉得他父亲身上那种久已泯灭的热情在他身上复活了：他最后竟使沉静的鲁思也激动起来。房间里的气氛越来越热烈，塞古安的工作也越来越难：甚至出现了个人攻击的危险。机敏的主人找机会举起了酒杯，要大家为博爱干杯，等大家饮罢之后，他不无含意地打开了一扇窗子。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7IXF20Sil", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1686720587, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "932173", "format": "epub", "version": 160268835, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/173/932173/s_932173.jpg", "title": "都柏林人（译文名著精选）", "author": "[爱尔兰]詹姆斯·乔伊斯", "translator": "王逢振", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "赛车以后", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "